Communication
1. Project Introduction

The team introduces the project Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value and explains its purpose.

2. Problem Explanation

The team explains the security problem related to unauthorized access to institution records.

3. Solution Explanation

The team explains how ServiceNow ACLs and field-based restrictions are used to control access.

4. Technical Explanation

The team explains the user roles, custom table, Branch field, and CRUD ACL configurations.

5. Team Communication

Each team member explains their assigned contribution during the project demonstration.

6. Conclusion

The team summarizes the implemented access-control solution and its expected benefits.
